{{root|ru|ine-pro|*sed-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|ходъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*xodъ}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*sed-|*sod-}}, whence Ancient Greek {{m|grc|ὁδός||threshold; road, path, journey}} and thereby English suffix {{m|en|-ode}}.

